      <description><![CDATA[<h2>OhNine 2.0: rebuilt as a native Mac app</h2>
<ul>
<li>About 5 MB, one download for Apple silicon and Intel</li>
<li>Signed and notarized by Apple, updates itself from now on</li>
<li>Syncs through claude.ai's own API in well under a second</li>
